im]prompts/202609/plan_approve_gateless_tales.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-18i[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-18i/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Direct approval engine[/bold #D7AFFF]                                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: add the backend for approving a plan with no live gate. This [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]covers archive and adoption helpers, direct-approval receipts wired into[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan history and `sase plan list`, the gate-history classifier, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolver/decision model with `#coder` prompt composition, the executor, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and coder follow-up fields on gate approval results.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CLI routing, output, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: default `--kind` to tale with an epic guard, and add `-n/--dry-run`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and `-P/--project`. Route live gates and gateless plans through one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]handler, render one approval card for every outcome, and update help, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, and CLI tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-18i","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-18i.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d379f5dd1fbd7d8006529417d504b542","started_at":"2026-09-24T23:32:05.202368+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true